[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186229142 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" "question-bf38a5cc-97dd-5fd2-8a65-012c6037d3ea"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/id #uuid "30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-334769" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=8x(t)+y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=8y(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the general solution to the system of ODEs above?\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.$*" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c \\\\  & ={e}^{At}\\,c \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t{e}^{8t} \\\\ {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-037bb8b1-8703-5c12-9a4f-1e911d252353"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-037bb8b1-8703-5c12-9a4f-1e911d252353" :answer-field/id #uuid "037bb8b1-8703-5c12-9a4f-1e911d252353" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" "answer-841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" "answer-3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" "answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" "answer-a62c7e30-2ca3-599f-a575-4381c820e214"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" :answer/id #uuid "3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-8t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" :answer/id #uuid "841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" :answer/id #uuid "3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-8t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer/id #uuid "9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a62c7e30-2ca3-599f-a575-4381c820e214" :answer/id #uuid "a62c7e30-2ca3-599f-a575-4381c820e214" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bf38a5cc-97dd-5fd2-8a65-012c6037d3ea" :question/id #uuid "bf38a5cc-97dd-5fd2-8a65-012c6037d3ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-334780" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=-11y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=11x(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the general solution to the system of ODEs above?\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -11 \\\\ 11 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$*" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -11 \\\\ 11 & 0\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -11 \\\\ 11 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c \\\\  & ={e}^{At}\\,c \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-79936db0-1d3e-5e44-88a9-d11010029275"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-79936db0-1d3e-5e44-88a9-d11010029275" :answer-field/id #uuid "79936db0-1d3e-5e44-88a9-d11010029275" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8e4da7fb-aa00-5923-b65b-fbadd3556bb1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8e4da7fb-aa00-5923-b65b-fbadd3556bb1" "answer-7eb32de8-beb1-587d-976e-749d47def0e5" "answer-3e869060-1415-5a53-b004-5d6325c73ada" "answer-cd9f1567-97e9-5878-aefd-205f500885f5" "answer-7e2a12ab-7764-5462-a802-0e9994f2e64f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8e4da7fb-aa00-5923-b65b-fbadd3556bb1" :answer/id #uuid "8e4da7fb-aa00-5923-b65b-fbadd3556bb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7eb32de8-beb1-587d-976e-749d47def0e5" :answer/id #uuid "7eb32de8-beb1-587d-976e-749d47def0e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-11t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3e869060-1415-5a53-b004-5d6325c73ada" :answer/id #uuid "3e869060-1415-5a53-b004-5d6325c73ada" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{11t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cd9f1567-97e9-5878-aefd-205f500885f5" :answer/id #uuid "cd9f1567-97e9-5878-aefd-205f500885f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7e2a12ab-7764-5462-a802-0e9994f2e64f" :answer/id #uuid "7e2a12ab-7764-5462-a802-0e9994f2e64f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{11t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(11t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186229143 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2b33a102-4fea-5f70-92e2-2161c498897e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-2b33a102-4fea-5f70-92e2-2161c498897e" :question/id #uuid "2b33a102-4fea-5f70-92e2-2161c498897e" :question/math-academy-id "q-335261" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=4y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=-4x(t),\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,\\begin{bmatrix}x(0) \\\\ y(0)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t)\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$*\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t)\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t)+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)\\, \\\\ \\,3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4t)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)\\,\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-64a55e92-d493-54e7-84af-e8deeb985a18" "answer-field-b1866003-fc3c-5d9e-8764-52cb8575aa9f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-64a55e92-d493-54e7-84af-e8deeb985a18" :answer-field/id #uuid "64a55e92-d493-54e7-84af-e8deeb985a18" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f967253c-021b-5838-91e6-7c052803d464" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f967253c-021b-5838-91e6-7c052803d464"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f967253c-021b-5838-91e6-7c052803d464" :answer/id #uuid "f967253c-021b-5838-91e6-7c052803d464" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\cos(4t)+3\\sin(4t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b1866003-fc3c-5d9e-8764-52cb8575aa9f" :answer-field/id #uuid "b1866003-fc3c-5d9e-8764-52cb8575aa9f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-abe86e93-7cf7-5b74-8bfd-e64b21724c60" :answer-field/choices ["answer-abe86e93-7cf7-5b74-8bfd-e64b21724c60"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-abe86e93-7cf7-5b74-8bfd-e64b21724c60" :answer/id #uuid "abe86e93-7cf7-5b74-8bfd-e64b21724c60" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cos(4t)-\\sin(4t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-63e1e863-a925-5a19-bc57-632e34220208" :activity/id #uuid "63e1e863-a925-5a19-bc57-632e34220208" :activity/title "Solving Homogeneous Systems of ODEs Using Matrix Methods" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048231 :activity/course 17592186046673 :activity/steps ["step-620a65a9-e0ce-58bf-92f8-c75eced0dac3" "step-6c542ad1-c4b6-56ed-a700-70bbf919ecf3" "step-bc3ed169-dd88-50e9-8554-7f86c6196060" "step-9ec12a4d-5b6a-50a6-83ef-b410f52319e4" "step-564ac6bf-4f9e-5182-8b4b-985a7206b4f9"] :activity/first-step "step-620a65a9-e0ce-58bf-92f8-c75eced0dac3" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-620a65a9-e0ce-58bf-92f8-c75eced0dac3" :step/id #uuid "620a65a9-e0ce-58bf-92f8-c75eced0dac3" :step/content 17592186308685 :step/next "step-6c542ad1-c4b6-56ed-a700-70bbf919ecf3" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-6c542ad1-c4b6-56ed-a700-70bbf919ecf3" :step/id #uuid "6c542ad1-c4b6-56ed-a700-70bbf919ecf3" :step/content "question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :step/next "step-bc3ed169-dd88-50e9-8554-7f86c6196060" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-bc3ed169-dd88-50e9-8554-7f86c6196060" :step/id #uuid "bc3ed169-dd88-50e9-8554-7f86c6196060" :step/content "question-bf38a5cc-97dd-5fd2-8a65-012c6037d3ea" :step/next "step-9ec12a4d-5b6a-50a6-83ef-b410f52319e4" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-9ec12a4d-5b6a-50a6-83ef-b410f52319e4" :step/id #uuid "9ec12a4d-5b6a-50a6-83ef-b410f52319e4" :step/content "question-2b33a102-4fea-5f70-92e2-2161c498897e" :step/next "step-564ac6bf-4f9e-5182-8b4b-985a7206b4f9" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-564ac6bf-4f9e-5182-8b4b-985a7206b4f9" :step/id #uuid "564ac6bf-4f9e-5182-8b4b-985a7206b4f9" :step/content 17592186311594 :db/ensure [:step/validate]}] "assertions" [["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/id #uuid "30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc"] ["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-334769"] ["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=8x(t)+y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=8y(t)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the general solution to the system of ODEs above?\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.$*"] ["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c \\\\  & ={e}^{At}\\,c \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} & t{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{8t} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t{e}^{8t} \\\\ {e}^{8t}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.$"] ["question-30506017-5a5b-5edb-a0ab-3934a44351cc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-037bb8b1-8703-5c12-9a4f-1e911d252353" :answer-field/id #uuid "037bb8b1-8703-5c12-9a4f-1e911d252353"] ["answer-3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" :answer/id #uuid "3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78"] ["answer-3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3c8af863-3b34-5962-91a8-483053b06d78" :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-8t}"] ["answer-841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" :answer/id #uuid "841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee"] ["answer-841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-841adc6b-ba73-5b39-b72e-15a5fc24aeee" :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}"] ["answer-3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" :answer/id #uuid "3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f"] ["answer-3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3f0f42e2-6ce8-54a5-9299-2786d1c68c5f" :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{8t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-8t}"] ["answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer/id #uuid "9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4"] ["answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9772b694-09ae-54c0-bc4c-bd95f31382f4" :answer/value "x(t)